@startuml

title Publish-Subscribe Basic Architecture\nEvent distribution through indirect communication

!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/component-diagram-style.iuml

component "Publisher A" as PA $deep_primary
component "Publisher B" as PB $deep_primary

component "Event Bus\n(Pub-Sub Connector)" as EB $deep_caution

component "Subscriber 1" as S1 $deep_ok
component "Subscriber 2" as S2 $deep_ok
component "Subscriber 3" as S3 $deep_ok

PA -right-> EB : announce
PB -right-> EB : announce

EB -right-> S1 : deliver
EB -right-> S2 : deliver
EB -right-> S3 : deliver

note bottom of EB
  Publishers and subscribers
  are decoupled - neither knows
  about the other's existence
end note

@enduml
